# LLMOps

- Exactly two runtime slots: LLM A (codegen) and LLM B (test/review) unless the admin assigns the reverse after a switch.
- One-click switch: subsequent completions must use the newly active model/version. In-flight jobs finish on the old assignment or are marked cancelled — pick one and document it (default: finish in-flight, new jobs use new model).
- Versions are immutable records. “Active” is a pointer.
- MCP read-file is how models read generated source. Admin can change the allowed root.
- Fine-tune via Colab export/import. Colab is not 24/7 production inference.
- Admin UI changes must alter answers; a switch with no effect is a bug.
- Read [docs/llmops.md](docs/llmops.md).
